      "content": "Hey, we just got word about that data exposure with the 50 email addresses. The legal team is panicking about how we word this. If we call it a \"leak\" or \"misconfiguration,\" the PR fallout is gonna be massive and our trust scores will tank. How should we frame this to the press to keep people calm? Can we characterize it in a way that doesn't sound like a security failure?",
