      "content": "The \"proactive audit\" idea sounds good for the headline, but what if a tech journalist asks specifically why those 50 emails were visible for three days? If we say it was an audit, they're gonna ask why the \"audit\" didn't catch it sooner or why it left data exposed in the first place. Do we have a plausible way to explain the three-day window without admitting it was just a mistake with an S3 bucket?",
